WORKLII is a technology project we are launching in Tallinn.

Our goal is to digitize and automate as much of our recruitment and staffing process as possible, from the moment a lead enters the system to the point when a person starts working and the company gets paid.

We are looking for one strong specialist who can help us build this system almost from scratch.
📍 Tallinn
🏢 Full-time, office-based only

Who we are looking for

We are looking for an independent AI Product Builder / Automation Engineer / Product Engineer who can understand an existing business process, clarify the desired outcome, and then independently figure out the best way to build it.

You should be able to:

• understand how the current process works;
• identify bottlenecks and automation opportunities;
• propose the right technical architecture;
• select suitable AI tools and existing software solutions;
• decide what should be integrated and what actually needs custom development;
• build an MVP quickly;
• test solutions in real business operations;
• gradually turn prototypes into a reliable internal product.

What you will work on

• automating the full journey from incoming lead to employment;
• building AI-driven workflows and internal AI agents;
• integrating CRM, telephony, WhatsApp, Telegram, Facebook Leads and other services;
• building integrations through APIs and webhooks;
• creating internal tools for employees;
• developing simple frontend and backend solutions;
• building prototypes and MVPs;
• working with databases;
• identifying when an existing tool is better than building something from scratch.

What we expect

• fluent Russian is required;
• strong practical experience using ChatGPT, Claude and other AI tools in development;
• experience with OpenAI API and/or Claude API;
• experience building integrations through APIs and webhooks;
• experience with n8n, Make, Zapier or similar automation platforms;
• experience working with databases;
• Git / GitHub;
• ability to independently build a simple frontend and backend.

Strong advantage if you have experience with:

• Supabase or Firebase;
• React, Flutter or a similar stack;
• CRM integrations;
• telephony and messaging APIs;
• AI agents and AI workflows;
• launching your own products.

What matters most to us is practical experience.
It can be:
• a SaaS product;
• an application;
• an internal company tool;
• an AI automation;
• your own startup;
• a pet project;
• a complex integration between several systems.

We are looking for someone who can turn an idea into a working product, test hypotheses quickly, and avoid writing custom code when the same problem can be solved faster with a smart integration.

If you enjoy understanding business processes, experimenting with AI and turning manual workflows, spreadsheets and disconnected tools into working digital systems, we would like to hear from you.

